  m_text: "The very first Ferris wheel was unveiled in 1893 at the World\u2019s Columbian
    Exposition in Chicago, designed by George Washington Gale Ferris Jr. It stood
    264 feet tall and was built to rival the Eiffel Tower. Since then, Ferris wheels
    have become a beloved part of fairs and festivals everywhere, offering riders
    breathtaking views and timeless thrills!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
