  m_text: "Don't let the dainty cups fool you\u2014this classic ride is full of dizzying
    delight! Inspired by the elegant English tea tradition, the Teacup Ride first
    spun onto the scene in the mid-20th century, quickly becoming a family favorite
    at fairs and theme parks around the world. With each cup spinning independently
    and rotating on a giant turntable, it\u2019s a swirl of laughter and excitement
    for all ages. Climb in, hold on tight, and get ready to twirl!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
